{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/extras/englishTopGif.gif?t=1718122649\" /><br><br>In the future, humanity is expanding by making stations in giant asteroids with the objective of colonizing and terraforming them. The Javelin V proved to be one of the richest colonies as it found a new material inside its asteroid, the Stardust. Yet the society of the Javelin V is divided into those that work extracting the minerals and those that run society with an iron fist.<br><br>Something is wrong in the colony, workers were rising against the elite, but everything has gone into chaos and Adler, a space mining engineer, will have to face impossible choices in order to save his brother and anyone that is still... human.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/extras/ENG_01_exploration.jpg?t=1718122649\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/extras/start_small.gif?t=1718122649\" /><br><br>While you are exploring the environment, you will find different types of enemies, interactive obstacles and puzzles that block access to new areas, along with collectible items such as munition, health, distraction, datapads, audio logs and key items with which to solve the puzzles.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/extras/ENG_02_combat_and_stealth.jpg?t=1718122649\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/extras/Hall_small.gif?t=1718122649\" /><br><br>To combat enemies, you must strategically take care of munition, moving stealthily and using distraction elements to avoid being overpowered, as the engineering uniform doesn't give you much protection.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/extras/ENG_03_physical_puzzles.jpg?t=1718122649\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/extras/crowbar_small.png?t=1718122649\" /><br><br>Physical puzzles will be solved with the help of your devices, allowing you to move obstacles, such as batteries, boxes, and machinery, among other things. Moving these objects will allow you to make traps, reach new places and break or repair machines.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/extras/ENG_04_mental_puzzles.jpg?t=1718122649\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/extras/Door_small.gif?t=1718122649\" /><br><br>The mental puzzles will be solved with the help of datapads and audio logs that will contain key information in the form of a riddle and also with key items directly interacting with machines or systems.<br>.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2474170?t=1718122649","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1718122649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1718122649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1718122649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game has zombies, blood splatters and dead personal around the station that the player will find throughout his play through. "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/extras/englishTopGif.g