amstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/extras/crowbar_small.png?t=1718122649\" /><br><br>Physical puzzles will be solved with the help of your devices, allowing you to move obstacles, such as batteries, boxes, and machinery, among other things. Moving these objects will allow you to make traps, reach new places and break or repair machines.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/extras/ENG_04_mental_puzzles.jpg?t=1718122649\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/extras/Door_small.gif?t=1718122649\" /><br><br>The mental puzzles will be solved with the help of datapads and audio logs that will contain key information in the form of a riddle and also with key items directly interacting with machines or systems.<br>.","developers":["Abstract Digital"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474170/header.jpg?t=1718122649","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257029532,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257029532/movie480.mp4?t=1717874116","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257029532/movie_max.mp4?t=1717874116"},"name":"LAGS Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257029532/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1717874116","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257029532/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1717874116","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257029532/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1717874116"}}],"name":"Astral Rot","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>